  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increased capacity of constituents to implement national employment policies and provide employment services addressing work transitions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ILO will continue supporting the tripartite constituents in their commitment to promote women&#x2019;s economic empowerment and gender equality agenda in the Republic of Azerbaijan. The ILO will assist the Government and relevant stakeholders in implementation of the relevant ratified conventions. The initiative will help to promote equal treatment and opportunities with particular reference to equal pay for work of equal value. 
In view of the upcoming UN Climate Change Conference in Baku, the ILO will increase efforts in promoting the agenda of gender responsive just transition and climate action and support the tripartite constituents to raise awareness on mainstreaming gender equality into national just transition policies and programmes. The efforts on mainstreaming gender equality will also be linked to the sectoral approaches with a focus on connection between care economy and just transition agenda.</narrative>
  </description>
